{"parentUuid":"f3d3f8bf-2cd0-4079-8699-66002acbc124","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"a89d19953587dd79f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TV8XKPHsP7G31zK4MyU7TC","type":"tool_result","content":"# CP-SAT Parameters\n\n## Branching and Polarity\n\n1. **preferred_variable_order** (IntFromOrderedListParameter)\n   - Default: 0 | Range: [0, 1, 2]\n\n2. **use_erwa_heuristic** (BoolParameter)\n   - Default: False\n\n3. **also_bump_variables_in_conflict_reasons** (BoolParameter)\n   - Default: False\n\n4. **use_phase_saving** (BoolParameter)\n   - Default: True\n\n## Conflict Analysis\n\n5. **binary_minimization_algorithm** (CategoryParameter)\n   - Default: 1 | Values: [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]\n\n6. **minimization_algorithm** (CategoryParameter)\n   - Default: 2 | Values: [0, 1, 2]\n\n## Clause Database Management\n\n7. **clause_cleanup_protection** (CategoryParameter)\n   - Default: 0 | Values: [0, 1, 2]\n\n8. **clause_cleanup_ordering** (CategoryParameter)\n   - Default: 0 | Values: [0, 1]\n\n## Presolve\n\n9. **cp_model_presolve** (BoolParameter)\n   - Default: True\n\n10. **presolve_bve_threshold** (IntFromOrderedListParameter)\n    - Default index: 1 | Values: [100, 500, 1000]\n\n11. **max_presolve_iterations** (IntFromOrderedListParameter)\n    - Default index: 2 | Values: [1, 2, 3, 5, 10]\n\n12. **cp_model_probing_level** (IntFromOrderedListParameter)\n    - Default index: 2 | Values: [0, 1, 2, 3]\n\n13. **presolve_probing_deterministic_time_limit** (IntFromOrderedListParameter)\n    - Default index: 4 | Values: [0.1, 1.0, 5.0, 10.0, 30.0]\n\n14. **encode_complex_linear_constraint_with_integer** (BoolParameter)\n    - Default: False\n\n## Constraint Programming\n\n15. **search_branching** (CategoryParameter)\n    - Default: 0 | Values: [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]\n\n16. **repair_hint** (BoolParameter)\n    - Default: False\n\n17. **use_lns_only** (BoolParameter)\n    - Default: False\n\n18. **use_lb_relax_lns** (BoolParameter)\n    - Default: False\n\n19. **use_objective_lb_search** (BoolParameter)\n    - Default: False\n\n20. **use_objective_shaving_search** (BoolParameter)\n    - Default: False\n\n21. **optimize_with_core** (BoolParameter)\n    - Default: False\n\n22. **feasibility_jump_linearization_level** (IntParameter)\n    - Default: 2 | Range: [0, 2]\n\n23. **fp_rounding** (CategoryParameter)\n    - Default: 2 | Values: [0, 1, 3, 2]\n\n24. **polish_lp_solution** (BoolParameter)\n    - Default: False\n\n## Max-SAT\n\n25. **core_minimization_level** (IntParameter)\n    - Default: 2 | Range: [0, 2]\n\n## Linear Programming Relaxation\n\n26. **linearization_level** (IntFromOrderedListParameter)\n    - Default index: 1 | Values: [0, 1, 2]\n\n27. **add_objective_cut** (BoolParameter)\n    - Default: False\n\n28. **boolean_encoding_level** (IntParameter)\n    - Default: 1 | Range: [0, 3]\n\n29. **cut_level** (IntParameter)\n    - Default: 1 | Range: [0, 2]\n\n30. **max_all_diff_cut_size** (IntFromOrderedListParameter)\n    - Default index: 1 | Values: [32, 64, 128]\n\n31. **symmetry_level** (IntFromOrderedListParameter)\n    - Default index: 2 | Values: [0, 1, 2]\n\n32. **num_workers** (IntFromOrderedListParameter)\n    - Default index: 0 | Values: [0, 8, 4]\n\n## Interval Constraints\n\n33. **use_strong_propagation_in_disjunctive** (BoolParameter)\n    - Default: False\n\n34. **use_area_energetic_reasoning_in_no_overlap_2d** (BoolParameter)\n    - Default: False\n\n35. **use_energetic_reasoning_in_no_overlap_2d** (BoolParameter)\n    - Default: False\n\n36. **use_timetabling_in_no_overlap_2d** (BoolParameter)\n    - Default: False\n\n37. **max_pairs_pairwise_reasoning_in_no_overlap_2d** (IntFromOrderedListParameter)\n    - Default index: 0 | Values: [1_250, 2_500, 5_000]"}]},"uuid":"52555a0f-35eb-4eb0-88e1-8e02f2700a29","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:05.957Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f3d3f8bf-2cd0-4079-8699-66002acbc124","userType":"external","en