{"parentUuid":"08ec2fa1-1f01-4007-b276-e1fcd75cf206","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"a89d19953587dd79f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J56uKxczGpqnWmLD8xHcZY","type":"tool_result","content":"# cpsat-autotune Project Configuration\n\n## Python Version\nThe project requires **Python 3.10 or later**.\n\n## Dependencies\nThe tool depends on several key packages:\n- **optuna** (version not specified)\n- **ortools** (version not specified)\n- **numpy**\n- **scipy**\n- **rich**\n- **click**\n\nBuild requirements include setuptools (≥45), setuptools_scm (≥6.2), wheel, and Cython.\n\n## Package Metadata\n- **Name:** cpsat-autotune\n- **Version:** 0.6.0\n- **Author:** Dominik Krupke (krupked@gmail.com)\n- **License:** MIT\n- **Status:** Alpha (Development Status 3)\n- **Description:** \"A tool to automatically tune the hyperparameters of the OR-Tools' CP-SAT solver.\"\n\nThe package is configured to be installed as a CLI command (`cpsat-autotune`) that invokes the main interface from the codebase's CLI module."}]},"uuid":"9a472e8e-c707-48d4-872d-aaa1c85e0330","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:12.600Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"08ec2fa1-1f01-4007-b276-e1fcd75cf206","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
